.TH DUB-REMOVE 1 "2026-08-16" "The D Language Foundation" "The D Language Foundation"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dub-remove \- Removes a cached package
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdub remove \fR<\fIpackage\fR>[@<\fIversion-spec\fR>] \fIOPTIONS\&.\&.\&.\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Removes a package that is cached on the local system.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR=\fIVALUE\fR
.RS 4
Use the specified version/branch instead of the latest available match
The remove command also accepts "*" here as a wildcard to remove all versions of the package from the specified location
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-force\-remove\fR
.RS 4
Deprecated option that does nothing
.RE
.PP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
.RS 4
Don't enter interactive mode.
.RE
.SS COMMON OPTIONS
See \fBdub\fR(1)
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.TP
.BR 0
DUB succeeded
.TP
.BR 1
usage errors, unknown command line flags
.TP
.BR 2
package not found, package failed to load, miscellaneous error
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
\fIdub\&.sdl\fR, \fIdub\&.json\fR
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Copyright (c) 1999-2026 by The D Language Foundation
.SH ONLINE DOCUMENTATION
.URhttp://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
http://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
.UE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdub\fR(1), \fBdub-clean\fR(1), \fBdub-clean-caches\fR(1)
